Zero point energy                ...      0.01193000 Eh       7.49 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00023981 Eh       0.15 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00094418 Eh       0.59 kcal/mol
